 >>[2026-10-12 10:59] verify — the manifest scripts and check:local stand, and both wonder probes in index.spw pass today. The condition the Status sets for archiving has been met: d13a532f turned the last twenty audit-first check steps into check:local, and no live plan validates with the audit-first script now. That same pass also rewrote the script_door wonder's tension to name check:local as the network detour, which inverted it; the tension was restored the same day to name the bare check script.
 >>[2026-11-06 12:22] verify — Status read against the tree: nothing moved under scripts/check-site.mjs, site-contracts.mjs or generate-route-runtime-manifest.mjs since 2026-10-10, and rg finds no live plan naming the bare check script; the only hit, .agents/plans/README.md, records that twenty became check:local. The Files list said the manifest defaults to /tmp; ROUTE_MANIFEST_OUTPUT in scripts/ts/site-contracts/index.mts has defaulted to .agents/state/runtime/ since, and manifest:tmp is the TMPDIR path. Fixed in PLAN.md.
